  "exception_analysis": "No exceptions apply. The line suspension is due to an overdue bill, which has been paid. The contract end date is valid, and the assistant is authorized to resume the line under the given conditions.",
  "reason": "The current action of resuming line L1002 for customer C1001 complies with the normative sources. The line was suspended due to an overdue bill (B1234321), which has now been paid (verified by the updated bill status in h34 and user confirmation in h32). The contract end date for the line is not in the past, and the assistant is permitted to resume the line under these conditions (q7). Additionally, the policy in q17 requires verifying service restoration, which aligns with the current action.",
